{'symbol': 'SEDG', 'date': '2022-08-29 18:02:00', 'title': "ITC ACCEPTS AMPT'S COMPLAINT TO INVESTIGATE IMPORTATION OF INFRINGING SOLAREDGE PRODUCTS", 'text': "FORT COLLINS, COLO.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMPT LLC, THE WORLD'S LEADING PROVIDER OF POWER OPTIMIZERS FOR LARGE-SCALE PHOTOVOLTAIC (“PV”) SYSTEMS, TODAY WELCOMED THE ANNOUNCEMENT THAT THE U.S. INTERNATIONAL TRADE COMMISSION (“ITC”) HAS INSTITUTED AN INVESTIGATION INTO SOLAREDGE TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NASDAQ: SEDG). THE ITC'S DECISION IS BASED ON A COMPLAINT FILED BY AMPT REQUESTING THAT THE ITC BAN THE IMPORT OF SOLAREDGE POWER SYSTEMS AND COMPONENTS THAT INFRINGE TWO OF AMPT'S PATENTS. AMPT ALSO SEEKS"}